      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Pharma & Biotech Clinical Trials, OpenFDA Recalls & NPI Provider Lead Radar (3-Actor Cascade)\n\nDaily life-sciences intelligence pipeline for biotech BD teams and healthcare funds: extracts Phase 2/3 studies on ClinicalTrials.gov, cross-checks OpenFDA adverse events/recalls, and enriches healthcare NPI providers.\n\n### Multi-Actor Cascade Powered by Apify Store (`@b2b-quant-apis`):\n- [`b2b-quant-apis/us-clinical-trials-biotech-radar`](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/us-clinical-trials-biotech-radar)\n- [`b2b-quant-apis/us-fda-recalls-safety-monitor`](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/us-fda-recalls-safety-monitor)\n- [`b2b-quant-apis/us-healthcare-npi-provider-lead-enricher`](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/us-healthcare-npi-provider-lead-enricher)\n\n**Setup:** Configure a single `httpHeaderAuth` credential (`Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN_HERE>`) across the Apify HTTP Request nodes and activate the Schedule Trigger.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 580,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "3b858e16-b046-55d7-9134-6cedfdce05d0",
      "name": "Enterprise Multi-Actor Waterfall Architecture",
